            { "id": "2", "number": 2, "question": "Fishermen took some water hyacinth plants to Lake Victoria.", "correct_answer": "FALSE", "explanation": "The passage explains that the plant moved out of Rwanda by traveling along the Kagera river until it reached Lake Victoria." },
